        "content": "Ugh!"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   ...that same dream again.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "...that same dream again."
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]   ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_143_ghost\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   Who is it?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "Who is it?"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   ...Oh, it's just you. Hm, I can't even seem to remember your name.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "...Oh, it's just you. Hm, I can't even seem to remember your name."
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1"
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]   That doesn't matter. Just treat me like any normal Rhodes Island operator.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "That doesn't matter. Just treat me like any normal Rhodes Island operator."
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]   You look like you're in pain.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "You look like you're in pain."
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_143_ghost\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost"
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   It's just another nightmare.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "It's just another nightmare."
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   Dark fragments swirling in my consciousness, hidden beneath the shadows of that broken church...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "Dark fragments swirling in my consciousness, hidden beneath the shadows of that broken church..."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   When I approach them, they turn into shackles and drag me down into the deep sea.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "When I approach them, they turn into shackles and drag me down into the deep sea."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1"
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]   ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]   But soon, there will be a way to escape your torment.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "But soon, there will be a way to escape your torment."
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_143_ghost\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   Heh, is that so? That'd be great. But why should I trust you?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "Heh, is that so? That'd be great. But why should I trust you?"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   Heh.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "Heh."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   Your aura... I'm quite familiar with it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "Your aura... I'm quite familiar with it."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   No, it's your smell. It's an intense, pungent smell... the smell of blood... 'their' smell. The smell of the deep sea.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "No, it's your smell. It's an intense, pungent smell... the smell of blood... 'their' smell. The smell of the deep sea."
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   It's a familiar and abhorrent smell.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "It's a familiar and abhorrent smell."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]   Is that so?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "Is that so?"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_143_ghost\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   Can you tell me your name?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "Can you tell me your name?"
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#1\",fadetime=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Skadi\"]   Skadi.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Skadi",
        "content": "Skadi."
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_143_ghost\",name2=\"char_263_skadi#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   Interesting. So, why did you decide to show up here?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "Interesting. So, why did you decide to show up here?"
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   You're not supposed to be here without permission from Kal'tsit, unless you're not afraid of me ripping you to pieces.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "You're not supposed to be here without permission from Kal'tsit, unless you're not afraid of me ripping you to pieces."
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_143_ghost\",name2=\"char_263_skadi#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Skadi\"]   I am afraid. Just like everyone else. However, I'm used to fear.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Skadi",
        "content": "I am afraid. Just like everyone else. However, I'm used to fear."
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Skadi\"]   It's time to go. By the time I come back, things may have already moved forward. However, you can forget all about me, just like before.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Skadi",
        "content": "It's time to go. By the time I come back, things may have already moved forward. However, you can forget all about me, just like before."
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_143_ghost\",name2=\"char_263_skadi#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"Specter\"]   Where are you going?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Specter",
        "content": "Where are you going?"
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_143_ghost\",name2=\"char_263_skadi#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_143_ghost",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Skadi\"]   To where the secret is buried.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Skadi",
        "content": "To where the secret is buried."
